        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sai-Kyo's commemorative first title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its simple controls and unexpected world setting sparked discussion, earning it the 1993 “Best Shooting Game Award” from several industry magazines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touhou Sengoku Kitan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tale from the distant past, at the eastern edge of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, a vibrant town culture, advanced technology, and ancient sorcery coexisted without contradiction, maintaining a long era of peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then, the heretical cult “Shinrakyo” plotted to overthrow the world by resurrecting an evil god, kidnapping Tsukihime, the daughter of the Shogun, as their sacrifice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six ace pilots, each harboring their own resolve, gather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, an astonishing aerial battle begins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● 8-direction lever + 2-button controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● 8 stages total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Supports 2-player simultaneous play and mid-game join.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Charge shots with the shot button to unleash special attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● 21 distinct multi-story paths / multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ 8-way joystick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Used to move your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ A button = Normal shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After powering up, also fires sub-weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up in 4 stages by collecting P (Power-Up) items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold down the A button (charge) and release to fire a Super Shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ B Button = Special Weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Essentially a bomb (crisis avoidance weapon).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ Jane Hayate</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 21 Gender: Female Occupation: Ninja</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Ship: Astonishing Ninja Glider Tobikage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful female ninja with blonde hair and blue eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She serves as the guardian of this nation's feudal lord and carries a secret mission to crush a heretical cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123500/extras/cb0b119e73539e96601944c44af13308.avif?t=1774415001\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ Turbo Monk Tengei</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 50 Gender: Male Occupation: Buddhist Monk</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable Craft: Spirit-Imbued Falcon, Mystic Bird Zenjiro</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A traveling monk who sensed evil and came to this land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A giant with incredible strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though his appearance is somewhat grubby, he possesses formidable spiritual power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123500/extras/88ded1a3e82de902f7929a6e77cbe9b3.avif?t=1774415001\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○Super Genius Dog Ken'ōmaru</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: Unknown Gender: Male Occupation: Genius Dog</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot: Supersonic Dogfighter Blue Fang</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A genius dog who handles high-tech fighter jets with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He understands human speech and calls himself the “King of Beasts” with absolute confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123500/extras/edd68a63232aacafb78534f279c9da96.avif?t=1774415001\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○The Wild Shrine Maiden Koyori</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 17 Gender: Female Occupation: Shrine Maiden</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot: Crimson Torii-Shaped Biplane God Wafoon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sent on a training journey due to her wild personality, she is the “Shrine's Wild Child.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite appearances, her magical power is formidable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123500/extras/63336aca3887beb99f74484b88d00a92.avif?t=1774415001\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○ Flash Aine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 25 Gender: Male Occupation: Samurai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player Craft: No Mercy Fighter Shinden J-9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A foreign samurai skilled in swordsmanship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He arrived in this country searching for his missing sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His appearance features blond hair, a topknot, and one eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123500/extras/70ea18f9fe6be1377093d10282c5b275.avif?t=1774415001\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >○Karakuri Master Gennai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age: 77 Gender: Male Occupation: Dutch Studies Scholar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot: Super Dutch Studies Fighter Elektel No. 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A genius Dutch studies scholar of the century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreaming of realizing an ideal society through Dutch learning, he sets out on a journey to reform the world alongside his assistant, the versatile karakuri robot “Ranmaru”.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123500/extras/4f01dab32e17e0eb45a58ef97319d585.avif?t=1774415001\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p>",
